WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.516 --> 00:00:01.956
- Go talk to 90-year-olds.

00:00:01.956 --> 00:00:04.115
They regret.

00:00:04.115 --> 00:00:06.356
They talk about regret.

00:00:06.356 --> 00:00:08.609
"I wish" is the opening line.

00:00:08.609 --> 00:00:09.956
Hey, man, tell me about your life.

00:00:09.956 --> 00:00:12.195
Literally, I wish.

00:00:12.195 --> 00:00:14.797
One by one at the airport,
at airport, park or park,

00:00:14.797 --> 00:00:17.479
event or event, bar or bar,

00:00:17.479 --> 00:00:19.115
every one of them,

00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:20.393
every one of them,

00:00:20.393 --> 00:00:23.690
all of them started with I wish.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.022
Al of them.

00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:28.834
I wish.

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.133
They grew up in a generation

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:32.340
that did not have the Internet.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.742
It was not practical to
do all the amazing things

00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:36.739
we can be doing.

00:00:36.739 --> 00:00:38.156
They all wished.

00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:39.642
They wished they worked harder.

00:00:39.642 --> 00:00:41.361
They wish they spent more
time with their family.

00:00:41.361 --> 00:00:43.264
They wish they didn't listen to their mom

00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:44.773
and did what they wanted to do.

00:00:44.773 --> 00:00:46.875
- I flew down without
my mom even knowing it.

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:48.755
- [Voiceover] He flew in just for this.

00:00:48.755 --> 00:00:49.917
- My mom didn't want to let me go.

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:52.354
Last day, I keep on
pushing, keep on pushing,

00:00:52.354 --> 00:00:53.202
keep on pushing.

00:00:53.202 --> 00:00:54.362
She lets me go.

00:00:54.362 --> 00:00:56.418
Now I'm here.

00:00:56.418 --> 00:00:58.740
- They wished, they wished, they wished.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:03.740
The biggest poison in us is regret.

00:01:03.744 --> 00:01:06.624
It's poison.

00:01:06.624 --> 00:01:09.537
And I push so hard, so hard,

00:01:09.537 --> 00:01:11.744
and will, through my vehicle,

00:01:11.744 --> 00:01:14.123
which isn't meditation,

00:01:14.123 --> 00:01:15.935
which isn't health and wellness,

00:01:15.935 --> 00:01:17.582
which isn't nonprofit.

00:01:17.582 --> 00:01:19.500
My vehicle's business.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.462
I can't help it.

00:01:20.462 --> 00:01:21.601
It's what I love.

00:01:21.601 --> 00:01:22.877
I love building businesses.

00:01:22.877 --> 00:01:23.760
I love competing with you.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:24.758
I want to beat you.

00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:26.024
I love that game.

00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:28.997
But through that vehicle,
I will always push

00:01:28.997 --> 00:01:31.817
a lack of regret and awareness

00:01:31.817 --> 00:01:33.397
to how good it really is.

00:01:33.397 --> 00:01:34.859
You're more than welcome to tell me about

00:01:34.859 --> 00:01:38.341
how bad it is or why you
can't because, for what.

00:01:38.341 --> 00:01:40.594
But it's just not true.

00:01:40.594 --> 00:01:43.195
Because if anybody ever did it,

00:01:43.195 --> 00:01:44.885
then you can, too.

